    "body": "State: the work and the gates are done. The branch is pushed. No PR is open yet, because PR #4123 is still open.\n\n- Branch: `issue/4027-kernel-law-suite`, head 1db488923. It starts from the head of PR #4123 (9ea79086c).\n- Content: the law suite in `crates/pathkernel/tests/laws/` (the existing binary `laws`, no new top-level test file). There is one generic check for each law L1-L7 and for the link rule. Stand-in planners obey each law, and one or more planners break it in a named way. A registry holds the 16 phase-1 kinds, each \"not on the kernel yet\". The decision file is `docs/decisions/4027-kernel-law-suite.md`.\n- No change in `crates/pathkernel/src`. No change in a planner.\n- Gates on this head:\n  - `laws`: 64 passed, 0.26 s.\n  - Quick gate against the head of PR #4123: 1 step, green.\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-pathkernel --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n  - `cargo xtask gate light`: 6 steps, green.\n- Next step: when PR #4123 merges, merge `origin/side/path-kernel` into the branch and run the quick gate again. Then open the draft PR with `--base side/path-kernel`.",
